{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25954","headline":"庐山石镜 · 鲍溶","name":"庐山石镜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东岩采薇人，岩际朝见月。\n怪堕幽萝间，非时更澄彻。\n绿萝就玉兔，再与高鸟歇。\n清光照掌中，始悟石上发。\n谁传阴阳火，铸此天地物。\n深影藏半山，虚轮带凝雪。\n早回谢公赏，今遇樵夫说。\n白日乘彩霞，翩翩对容发。\n我图辨鬼魅，信美留烟阙。\n形神乍相逢，竟夕难取别。\n如其终身照，可化黄金骨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25954.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25954","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}